{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:45 2026-05-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:45 2026-05-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:45 2026-05-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"「北地烈馬」一放到底\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/1899dccb09da35d84dc0dfefaf723385/2026-05/r2_1.jpg\"/><p>繼上月的「偵探傳奇」之後，今午練馬師葉楚航與見習騎師袁幸堯再次攜手贏馬，在第二場憑「北地烈馬」一放到底勝出，袁幸堯已連續三個賽日贏馬，今季頭馬數字達七場。</p><p>賽後練馬師葉楚航說：「『北地烈馬』個子比較矮細，用見習騎師袁幸堯減十磅大有幫助，是今場的爭勝關鍵。同場有數匹年輕質新馬，牠們未必懂得後追，賽前我對袁幸堯表示出閘後盡量自造步速，入直路後二、三百米才開鞭。『北地烈馬』是匹忠心準繩的馬，只要遇有利形勢，牠能擺前走控制步速走勢暢順的話，便可交出應有水準，而今日場地起變化，對此馬亦有利。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4489c1dd4dc2f6ff0a30880e1b88fe77/2026-05/03a4623d-b61e-4678-92fe-d4e2e9279022.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a7ac2bd00f5d3edb07b1c02f46ba2277/2026-05/4f6040fd-3dee-43d3-b5f7-10104bb39451.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/31491e970a0614bb41475f7d4d773022/2026-05/06c996c1-1fdd-4b89-82a9-c934e8d72907.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6781f4dd65b6b875eb47940559606a5d/2026-05/43f8610c-c3e0-4831-b721-59d171dad0c8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5a1a4dc38a5dc36e4f66180df74698ce/2026-05/045c8a49-ded9-4d44-a6ef-c52d578f6a78.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fa48e255b0b30f00c9f52e342464207c/2026-05/60ea9d39-adcd-4e56-8892-887d47bbff16.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c4b76768a27a4b9be8b13c060647c961/2026-05/2142b79c-e2f2-462b-b675-ccaa8848ad2a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0bab1e97235fe206123072c0f86743cf/2026-05/9565e6a8-83d0-48d9-84ce-c14f572363a8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6feb56ac3af1988883853dcd783145dd/2026-05/2719340e-766a-40e1-98e6-3b5592029fdf.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4cc00b037aa78f0156298a48b193b869/2026-05/bfc55abb-2ec6-4c6e-a126-1be0b7bec988.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/42eeb0ff746dfd05512022559106364b/2026-05/ca64a403-b618-486e-a6a0-592a30401131.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/058194791a60e14a550df3481fa8e3a8/2026-05/cd27fe2e-064f-49a1-bad3-16c5fc6a4483.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f3493fb91c40d6867914f5a6ef1a1b50/2026-05/cdf4f1dd-d3ad-460f-965b-7de106d67712.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6f85fa1fa1518745955346c85e90616b/2026-05/fb30528c-9dc1-488a-9911-c4d40e63c07e.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-09T06:24:39.122076+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}